 { "id": "all-six-reversed", "text": "z = −3.17, p = .002; r(58) = .31, p = .016; H(2) = 9.57, p = .008; χ²(1, N = 120) = 3.84, p = .050; F(1, 22) = 0.30, p = .588; t(58) = 2.36, p = .022." },
 { "id": "results-paragraph", "text": "Participants in the treatment group (M = 4.2, SD = 1.1) scored higher than controls (M = 3.5, SD = 1.3), t(58) = 2.36, p = .022, d = 0.61. A one-way ANOVA on the three conditions was significant, F(2, 57) = 4.52, p = .015, and condition was unrelated to gender, χ²(2, N = 60) = 5.99, p = .050. Ranks differed across the groups, H(2) = 9.57, p = .008; scores were correlated, r(58) = .31, p = .016, and a Wilcoxon test gave z = −3.17, p = .002." },
 { "id": "hindi-prose", "text": "परिणाम: दोनों समूहों में अंतर था, t(58) = 2.36, p = .022 ।" },
